blurb: The South Portland School Board convened to evaluate three superintendent search
  firms, ultimately selecting Zeal Education Group. The decision, made after extensive
  discussion on each firm's approach to community engagement, candidate recruitment,
  and post-hire support, aims to find the best fit for the district's unique needs
  and foster board consensus.
